    "de": [
      "Ein einzigartiger Ort, der der Geschichte der Gerechten und des Widerstands während des Zweiten Weltkriegs gewidmet ist."
    ],
    "en": [
      "A place dedicated to the history of Le Chambon-sur-Lignon and the surrounding villages during the World War II. The memorial presents the history of the Righteous. Located in the centre of Le Chambon-sur-Lignon, it is for anyone who wants to learn more about this exceptional past. \r\n\r\nA unique Place dedicated to the History of the Righteous and the non-violent resistance during World War II."
    ],
    "it": [
